MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kai_m01_001: Hey, at least the scenery's nice.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kai_m02_001: You can never train too much.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kai_m03_001: The sky's kinda really far up there, huh?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kai_m04_001: It's kind of exciting to be on the road with everyone.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kai_m05_001: I wonder if there's someplace we could go fishing...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bel_m01_001: After all the time in that cell, I'm just grateful to\nbe outside.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bel_m02_001: The sky, it's so high.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bel_m03_001: Wherever one goes, one finds lively people enjoying\ntheir lives...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dit_m01_001: I thirst. Soon, I must drink.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dit_m02_001: I smell blood on the wind. It is a good scent.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dit_m03_001: In a new land, the view is also new.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tal_m01_001: No matter how many centuries go by, this land\ndoesn't change at all, does it?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tal_m02_001: I still remember the faces and names of everyone\nwho's ever been a part of this company.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tal_m03_001: Flourish in this business long enough, and you almost\nseem to attract the envy of others.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Orh_m01_001: The world is a vast place!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Orh_m02_001: It's delightful to see how the land changes!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Orh_m03_001: I don't get tired, so I'm glad to shepherd\neveryone along!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Seo_m01_001: To be a queen requires, as a matter of course, that I\nset an example for all to follow.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Seo_m02_001: I shall fulfill the long-held dream of Saramis during\nmy reign. No matter the cost.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Led_m01_001: Some people in this world should not be alive.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Led_m02_001: Hmm, a melody just came to me. I ought to write\nit down.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Led_m03_001: I envy birds. Wish I could fly like them...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Anh_m01_001: I knew the world was big, but there's a big difference\nbetween knowing something and seeing it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Anh_m02_001: Traveling the outside world has shown me just how\nharsh our environment was in the village.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Anh_m03_001: We need to be careful all the time. We don't want\nanyone figuring out who we are.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tia_m01_001: One thing I've learned is that you increase your\nchances of tripping if you read while walking.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tia_m02_001: I wonder how my grandpa's doing.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pet_m01_001: I'm sooo hungry...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pet_m02_001: I keep thinking that cloud we saw looked tasty...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pet_m03_001: It'd be nice if we could relax, at least a little bit.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pet_m04_001: I'm really good with my bow, but I'm a lousy hunter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hur_m01_001: I wonder if Dad's eating right.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hur_m02_001: It's nicer here than I thought it'd be.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hur_m03_001: Seems like we ought to be able to make a nice dinner\nwith all the things around here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hur_m04_001: Sleeping outdoors really makes you appreciate nights\nspent in your own bed in your own home.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hur_m05_001: We've come pretty far, haven't we?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fab_m01_001: The air here is pleasantly humid.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fab_m02_001: One must hydrate frequently.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fab_m03_001: This region, too, is utterly transformed from its\nearlier state.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fab_m04_001: Unfamiliar plants grow here. They must be endemic\nto this land.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Esm_m01_001: It's not good to push yourself too hard, y'know?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Esm_m02_001: Sometimes I get a little homesick for Fina.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Esm_m03_001: Staying on land is much more peaceful than being at\nsea. My feet are firmly planted!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mic_m01_001: I don't have as much stamina as I used to, but that's\nonly natural.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mic_m02_001: Rest when you get the chance. You'll thank me later.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mic_m03_001: I wonder where that ex-husband of mine crawled to\nand what mischief he's up to now.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mic_m04_001: If you're tired, I'll make you a delicious cup of coffee.\nJust ask.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mic_m05_001: I've been cheated my whole life. Angry doesn't even\nbegin to cover it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bon_m01_001: Both prosperity and adversity can be sources of\npersonal growth.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bon_m02_001: We veterans must always strive to set a standard\nfor the warriors of Saramis.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bon_m03_001: One must not overstrain oneself before justice\ncan be done.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Bon_m04_001: Enforcing harmony and unity at all times is the\nfoundation of troop movement.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tob_m01_001: Man, I'm starting to get hungry.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tob_m02_001: It's not great to strain yourself, ya know? Slow and\nsteady and all that.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tob_m03_001: Reminds me of my younger days when the old king\ndispatched me all over the place.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tob_m04_001: Think there's any ale to be found here?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lil_m01_001: You might not guess this about me, but I'm actually\na pretty solid hunter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lil_m02_001: I'm used to camping outdoors, so wherever you want\nto rest is fine.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lil_m03_001: I'll follow you anywhere, I guess, as long as there's\na payday in it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lil_m04_001: Ready to make another push?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lys_m01_001: I want my military deeds to surpass even my father's.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lys_m02_001: I'm ashamed to admit it, but...I do not care for coffee.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lys_m03_001: No matter where you look up at it from, the sky is\nthe same in every land.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lys_m04_001: Loyal devotion to one's superiors is expected for\na military man.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lys_m05_001: In truth, I get angry sometimes when I see people\nwho don't take things seriously enough.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Buc_m01_001: I can't fall behind the young ones.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Buc_m02_001: I dislike cowards. They cannot be considered\nwarriors.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Buc_m03_001: A settlement's shops carry a variety of different\nproducts. We'd best stop in regularly.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Buc_m04_001: I consider my burn scar to be a badge of honor.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sci_m01_001: Mm...a pleasing air.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sci_m02_001: I am always on the lookout for belles who make my\nheart flutter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sci_m03_001: One must set aside trivialities and attend to the\nlarger picture.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sci_m04_001: Why the rush? Even the strongest gust calms.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Moo_m01_001: Ah, nice to have a little shade.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Moo_m02_001: Is there anything tastier than veggie hot pot?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Moo_m03_001: You don't realize how big the world is until you go\nout and explore it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Moo_m04_001: Y'know, I'd love to learn how to play an instrument.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Oly_m01_001: One can find inspiration anywhere! In the whistling\nof the wind or the song of the birds.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Oly_m02_001: The more traveling I do, the more I realize I am not\nsuited for it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Oly_m03_001: Eugh! My perspiration is such that my hair's gotten\nsticky. How unpleasant.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Oly_m04_001: There, ah... There won't be bugs here, will there?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gat_m01_001: I'm an experienced traveler. What—does that\nsurprise you?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gat_m02_001: In the land of Sai, I was once given an unusual food.\nIt was like cheese but made from beans.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gat_m03_001: It's best to keep up with one's exercise.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gat_m04_001: One skill a warrior learns? How to fall asleep\nanywhere.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Max_m01_001: Phew... Hope the sweating doesn't make my\nmakeup run.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Max_m02_001: Boredom. Nothin' a clown hates more.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Max_m03_001: Damn it! Sleeve got caught on a thorn. I'm gonna\nhave to mend that.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Max_m04_001: Made this outfit myself. What, is that weird?\nA clown who likes to sew?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gol_m01_001: Guys like me are liable to get stuck in tight places.\nNo fun!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gol_m02_001: Hey, just asking. If I was hungry, would it be alright\nif I choked some cattle and ate 'em?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gol_m03_001: No matter how few rations we've got, you better not\ntell me to eat grass off the road.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gol_m04_001: I don't like busywork. Or anything too—y'know—\nthinky.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Gol_m05_001: You know what I want? A bathtub filled with booze.\nGet in, take a drink, nap. Take a drink, nap. Bwaha!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dan_m01_001: Our capacity for attachment is what distinguishes us\nas human. Wouldn't you say?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dan_m02_001: I didn't choose the form I was born into, but I'd say\nit's not lacking for appeal.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dan_m03_001: How I detest stained walls. The longer I look at those\nsplotches, the more they resemble faces!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dan_m04_001: The seeds of a great story lie everywhere. To be a\ngreat writer, one must be able to recognize them.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dan_m05_001: Your life is composed of only so many hours. Why\nwaste them consuming twelve-course meals?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Urs_m01_001: If I WERE to become a beast...I hope...that I would\nat least become some kind of bird.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Urs_m02_001: Calculations are my forte.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Urs_m03_001: What are called godmarks here are typically called\ncrests in my homeland.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Urs_m04_001: Budgets are important, but remember, you must\noften spend money to make money.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Urs_m05_001: To understand an animal's needs, you only need to\nlook it in the eyes and open yourself to its feelings.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sim_m01_001: You should always respect the prey. Because, in a\nweird way, you're entrusting your life to it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sim_m02_001: Wild-animal blood is great for replenishing your\nfluids. Keeping that in mind could save your life.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sim_m03_001: You won't find many nice guys in the mercenary\nbusiness. Being soft will get you killed quick.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sim_m04_001: Sometimes I want to eat the stuff I used to have as\na kid... But I don't think that'll happen anytime soon.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lou_m01_001: I may not look it, but I'm actually the youngest of\nmy siblings.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lou_m02_001: I have such a great memory.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lou_m03_001: Hrm... What I wouldn't do for a bath...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lou_m04_001: I want to do something great—something the whole\nworld will talk about one day!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lou_m05_001: I love my family. Military teachings or not, I'm proud\nto be my father's daughter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fia_m01_001: Do you believe in the power of love?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fia_m02_001: This love in my chest... I can feel its heat. One day,\nit might just set that man ablaze...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fia_m03_001: Huh? What was that feeling just now? Like...I was\nabout to remember something. Strange...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fia_m04_001: Sometimes I wonder if I made some grave mistake in\nmy past... Something I can't take back.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Fia_m05_001: If you're feeling tired, spicy foods are a great way to\nwake yourself up.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Die_m01_001: I... I need to get stronger.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Die_m02_001: I have to admit that I have mixed feelings about the\npeople of Saramis.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Die_m03_001: I learned my survival skills from the Har Hali.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Die_m04_001: If it weren't for Orchel... I wouldn't be here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Die_m05_001: To some extent, I'm grateful to the temples.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lor_m01_001: Come on! Let's keep going!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lor_m02_001: Huh... The world's full of all kinds of stuff.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lor_m03_001: Ugh! Some dirt got up into my mouth!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lor_m04_001: Sleeping on the ground's rough. My body hurts!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Lor_m05_001: I'll follow you anywhere...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Set_m01_001: A foreign land—what adventure!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Set_m02_001: The ecology of this area is fascinating.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Set_m03_001: I must find a gift for Flayn in this land.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Set_m04_001: The dye in my hair might wear out in time...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Set_m05_001: What do you mean I always look grumpy? Why are\nwe talking about this?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nin_m01_001: The spirits around here are active.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nin_m02_001: Oh, wondering about me? Well...I suppose I'm\ndoing fine.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nin_m03_001: My life, my work—it keeps me in Dagsion.\nGoing elsewhere is exciting.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nin_m04_001: I sense...that something nice will happen at some\npoint today.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sar_m01_001: Don't you get curious about other people's love lives? 
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sar_m02_001: I wonder if everyone in the village is doing well.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sar_m03_001: I taught myself magic growing up in the village.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sar_m04_001: You know, now that I think of it, I've never once had\nan upset stomach.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sar_m05_001: I've been told I'm hard to read. I've always thought\nthat was silly. I'm very open with my emotions.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Naz_m01_001: Since the world is so big, maybe I can get taller and\nfit into it better.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Naz_m02_001: I'm as strong as anything! Though...I'm lacking in\nother ways.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Naz_m03_001: I figure that if I'm going to eat something, I want it to\nbe something that's gonna help me get taller.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Naz_m04_001: Know what makes me feel great? Winning a fight\nagainst someone stronger than me.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dai_m01_001: Meat's real good, but fish is also insanely tasty. I can\neat all the fish you can catch!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dai_m02_001: Everybody always looks at me weird when they find\nout I'm good at tinkering with machines.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dai_m03_001: I like lots of ladies. Why? That a problem?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dai_m04_001: If something's bothering ya, I'm always here to listen.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Dai_m05_001: I'm hungry.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hal_m01_001: Traveling with everyone is always so much fun!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hal_m02_001: I wish I could go home... Too bad that's not possible.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hal_m03_001: I get lots of compliments on my dexterity.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Hal_m04_001: Someday, I wanna buy some land and have my very\nown farm.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Guj_m01_001: The truth is...that my family descended from those\ndriven out by the king during the Zodiac Incident.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Guj_m02_001: I used to cross ALL of Dagda in a single day, back\nwhen I was a spry kid!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Guj_m03_001: In days gone by, I could throw a rope around\nmountains and pull 'em closer.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Guj_m04_001: I live by one motto: "Gotta keep things interesting!"
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Guj_m05_001: Before I got my face scar, they used to call me the\nAdonis of Dagda—most handsome guy around!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ned_m01_001: I get a strong craving for sweets when I've been on\nthe move for a while.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ned_m02_001: It's been a very long time since I left home. I hope\nthe people I knew then are doing well.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ned_m03_001: Fighting strong foes sharpens my abilities, so I\nwelcome the risk.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ned_m04_001: Young soldiers look up to me, though I did abandon\nSaramis when I was younger. They forget that.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ned_m05_001: I have thrown myself into mercenary work fully.\nBut I never took a job beneath my dignity.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Noc_m01_001: Maybe I'll get some training in during my spare time.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Noc_m02_001: Hey, how do people keep it under control when\nthey lose their cool?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Noc_m03_001: You eat whatever you scavenge—you'll wreck your\nstomach for sure!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Noc_m04_001: I look pretty slick, right? I hope so!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Noc_m05_001: I get the feeling something good's going to happen to\nus today!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sop_m01_001: I eat so much. I can't imagine where it all goes!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sop_m02_001: I'd welcome some food, but I wouldn't say no to a\ndrink to go with it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sop_m03_001: I'll spread word of how great Lord Solel is—far\nand wide!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Sop_m04_001: Any time I see bandits run riot reminds me a little of\nhow I grew up!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Yan_m01_001: Pursue nothing too intensely. That is the best advice\nfor living a long life.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Yan_m02_001: The wisdom you gain from traveling from here to\nthere—that is life's real treasure.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Yan_m03_001: I once encountered a drink in the land of Sai that\nwas made from fermented kiwi berries. Delicious!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Yan_m04_001: In Rama, off in the east, there's said to be a "nectar\nof immortality." Sounds like good drinking!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Yan_m05_001: I served as a priest in a temple for a time, but I came\nto doubt the gods...and became a wanderer.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cat_m01_001: It's good to have something to keep you busy, right?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cat_m02_001: No matter how hard things get, I need to remember\nmy noble upbringing.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cat_m03_001: Those who are sterling know sterling when they\nsee it. That's nobility for you.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cat_m04_001: I've made so many painful sacrifices to achieve a\nbrighter future for myself.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cat_m05_001: Those fruit trees we passed a while ago... I should\nsneak back there and pick some.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Maj_m01_001: Feed the great Majide. That's the secret to getting a\ngood job out of him!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Maj_m02_001: The great Majide thinks nothing of a little trip like\nthis. Bring it on—more!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Maj_m03_001: Need to know a good prison from a bad one? You\njust ask the great Majide!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Maj_m04_001: Bet I could make a cave somewhere into a whole\nfortress if I wanted.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Maj_m05_001: My body wants training and strength—not stupid\nbrushes with lovey-dovey nonsense!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kir_m01_001: Heh heh! I'm really feeling it today!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kir_m02_001: They used to call me the BEST pirate king—now\nand forevermore!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Kir_m03_001: How I've fallen... Used to boss around the worst\nkind of brutes. Look at me now.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Iio_m01_001: Never let your guard down, even when it's calm.\nMy father used to advise that.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Iio_m02_001: The fact is...I'm not sure I'm cut out for the\nmercenary life.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Iio_m03_001: People who doubt where to put their loyalties have\nno business being a knight.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Iio_m04_001: I might get used to the mercenary life, if I give it\nenough time perhaps.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Iio_m05_001: Are you alright? Don't push too hard.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nuz_m01_001: Strength will serve you well in all areas of life.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nuz_m02_001: Though I was driven from my land, I am still a proud\nHar Hali.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Nuz_m03_001: It is well known that a Har Hali warrior can run\n250 miles in a day.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pep_m01_001: The role of king in Brigid puts responsibility over 60\nislands on one's shoulders—and seven isle clans!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pep_m02_001: We don't admire cuisine that puts showiness\nbefore flavor.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pep_m03_001: All things we see here are of great interest to us!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pep_m04_001: Oh, how we long to see nature spirits with our\nown eyes...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Pep_m05_001: We traveled across the sea in order to broaden our\nviews—immensely, if we can!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Zac_m01_001: I'm not gonna hang out with weaklings forever...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Zac_m02_001: I was gonna win the Heroic Games and take it easy\nfor the rest of my days. But it, uh...didn't work out.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Zac_m03_001: That merchant we passed a while back had an\nawful lot of goods on him, didn't he...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Zac_m04_001: Any time I see soldiers on patrol, I grit my teeth until\nthey're ready to break. You too?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Zac_m05_001: There's a trick to slicing through logs, easy as\nbutter... I'll grab my axe and show ya sometime.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ven_m01_001: You're a real taskmaster, aren't you?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ven_m02_001: Woo-hoo! I love a good campaign!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ven_m03_001: I've read my favorite book on tactics many times.\nAlways learn something new from it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ven_m04_001: Even the best generals will get hungry, walking on\nand on like this...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Jas_m01_001: You know you can rely on me, right? A lot, if you\nneed to.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Jas_m02_001: My clan name was inspired by a legend about a\nrain spirit.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Jas_m03_001: Hey, you'd better take good and decent care of\nthe people close to you. Understand?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Jas_m04_001: I've gotten used to it by now, but Dagda's a lot hotter\nthan Brigid.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Jas_m05_001: I'll return to my original home someday, maybe...\nUntil then, I'm fine being in this land.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ale_m01_001: We can't let our guard down. Not even if we're sure\nthere aren't enemies near.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ale_m02_001: It's nice to chat with everyone while we travel.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ale_m03_001: I'll assist you with all my strength—no matter what\nhappens to us.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ale_m04_001: Traveling as we are... Is this what real freedom\nfeels like?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ale_m05_001: I have dreams about my parents. They've been\nlong gone—departed from this world.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ini_m01_001: I'm...not exactly on strong footing when it comes\nto dealing with men.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ini_m02_001: Um...don't push yourself too hard. Once you strain\nyour body too much, there's no coming back.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ini_m03_001: I need to earn money—and repay everyone back\nhome who helped me out.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ini_m04_001: The magic bow... Sometimes I still feel its effects...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Ini_m05_001: I've excelled at archery ever since I was very little.\nReally, it's the only thing I'm good at.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tro_m01_001: I may look old, but we Mediators are heartier than\nyou would expect.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tro_m02_001: I stopped keeping track of my exact age a long, long\ntime ago.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tro_m03_001: I've probably been active for much longer than you\ncan imagine.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tro_m04_001: It takes effort to look closely enough to see your\nsurroundings clearly. Keep that in mind.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tro_m05_001: Hm? Oh, don't you worry about me.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cen_m01_001: I ask that you not overdo it. Please.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cen_m02_001: I've had friends call me obstinate, but is that such a\nbad thing to be?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cen_m03_001: Control yourself and stay aware of your surroundings.\nDo that, and you will be safe from ambush.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Cen_m04_001: My tracking abilities are better than most\npeople assume.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mra_m01_001: Now let us continue our journey.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mra_m02_001: I love traveling. I feel free.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mra_m03_001: A dangerous adventure is much more worthy than\na safe, boring, empty life.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mra_m04_001: What nice weather. I feel like I can do whatever\nI want.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Mra_m05_001: People wear many different masks.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tah_m01_001: Sometimes I look back fondly on the days that I\ntoiled on my training.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tah_m02_001: I'll do all I can to restore the world to what it was.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tah_m03_001: The Python Technique's movement style helps you\nwalk without a sound.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tah_m04_001: The carnage caused by the underworld's armies...\nIt must end.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Normal_Tah_m05_001: I'll make sure to keep myself fighting fit.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Kai_m01_001: If I'd never left the village, I wouldn't have any idea\njust how big the world really is.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Kai_m01_001: The smell of the sea breeze isn't so bad.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Kai_m01_001: All these paving stones were laid by hand. It's kind\nof unbelievable.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Bel_m01_001: This march through the sands is even more arduous\nthan I imagined.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Bel_m01_001: Some snakes can deliver a fatal bite before you've\nseen or heard them. We must stay on guard.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Bel_m01_001: As a man born and raised inland, I feel a certain\nsense of vertigo looking at the sea.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Bel_m01_001: Am I pushing too hard?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Bel_m01_001: There's danger. I sense it.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Dit_m01_001: It is hot.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Dit_m01_001: The dark of night is a beautiful thing.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Dit_m01_001: When I smell the sea...I remember our meeting.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Dit_m01_001: This land is vast.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Dit_m01_001: I will soon find the pleasure I seek.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Tal_m01_001: I wonder if the locals here use the dunes on the\nhorizon as landmarks.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Tal_m01_001: Nothing sings to my heart more than the smell of\nthe sea breeze.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Tal_m01_001: Well, let's try to stay this course for now. Steady on!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Tal_m01_001: Whew... Push any harder, and I'm gonna tucker\nmyself out.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Tal_m01_001: Something here stinks... Can't lose the stench no\nmatter what I do.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Orh_m01_001: I've got to walk with care. Otherwise, sand might\nmake a mess of my joints!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Orh_m01_001: The world comes alive at night, doesn't it? So many\ncreatures, alive and well.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Orh_m01_001: You know, Credna warned me to be cautious around\na salty sea breeze.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Orh_m01_001: I've got to be careful when walking here. I might\ncrack the pavement by accident!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Orh_m01_001: I've got to watch my footing here. The steepness of\nthe path is a little tricky for me.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Seo_m01_001: Was this the sort of terrain that our ancestors, the\nPeople of the White Egg, claimed as their home?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Seo_m01_001: I suppose I inherited my excellent night vision from\nmy parents.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Seo_m01_001: The vastness of the sea is equaled only by our \nmother's love.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Seo_m01_001: This sort of terrain puts me in mind of our\ntrailblazing ancestors.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Seo_m01_001: Ought we to take a brief respite?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Seo_m01_001: My heart pounds in my chest, as it does when I am\nunder threat.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Led_m01_001: Gods! I can feel my skin drying out...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Led_m01_001: I don't mind a journey. Something I inherited from\nmy ancestor, maybe.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Led_m01_001: A bustling tavern and a warm bed are sounding\npretty nice right now.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Led_m01_001: There's something about this place... I don't know.\nMaybe we should check it out.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Led_m01_001: Something's feeling ominous.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Anh_m01_001: The stars surround us at night, as if they're holding\nus close.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Anh_m01_001: I've mostly gotten used to seeing it, but I'm still really\namazed by how much water there is in the world.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Anh_m01_001: As we travel, each place has a new kind of terrain.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Anh_m01_001: It might be time to take a break.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Anh_m01_001: There's something strange about this place.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Tia_m01_001: Not a lot of shade out here, huh?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Tia_m01_001: It's so much more pleasant to travel at night.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Tia_m01_001: This highway is so large.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Tia_m01_001: My glasses keep slipping when we walk on uneven\npaths like this.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Tia_m01_001: We should probably discuss stopping for a rest soon.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Tia_m01_001: It looks like there could be something here. Shall we\nhave a look around?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Pet_m01_001: It's so hot. I'm gonna get so thirsty so fast...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Pet_m01_001: It's hot in the daytime, but it's always cold at night.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Pet_m01_001: Isn't everyone else kind of tired from walking?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Pet_m01_001: Hey, um, can we have a break soon?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Hur_m01_001: I wouldn't mind if the sun went somewhere else\nfor a while.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Hur_m01_001: Looking at the sky full of stars makes me think\nof Aurora.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Hur_m01_001: It's hard to walk here. I lose my footing constantly.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Fab_m01_001: Hot... Dry... Ah, the sun—how it vexes me!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Fab_m01_001: When the sun is not showing, I take my ease. It is\npleasant indeed.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Fab_m01_001: Do not forget to take a short break, at least—but it\nwould not do to dally too long.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Fab_m01_001: There are many points of interest nearby. Come, let\nus collect some specimens.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Esm_m01_001: When I catch a whiff of the sea breeze, I can relax\na little.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Esm_m01_001: We've been walking forever. Aren't you\ngetting hungry?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Esm_m01_001: Hey, it's time for a break.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Esm_m01_001: The air around here is different.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Esm_m01_001: There's blood in the air.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Mic_m01_001: What do you say to a breather? We've been walking\nawhile now.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Mic_m01_001: I think there's something around here...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Mic_m01_001: Careful, now. Eyes forward.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Bon_m01_001: Gazing at the sea sets my heart aflutter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Bon_m01_001: The Dagdan Empire is impressive to have such well-\nmaintained roads to the farthest reaches of the land.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Bon_m01_001: Ohoho! Life on the road is hard on these old bones.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Bon_m01_001: One cannot always be in a hurry. Rest is called for\nwhen necessary.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Tob_m01_001: The stars are bright tonight.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Tob_m01_001: Travel always reminds me what a big world it is.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Tob_m01_001: Just a hunch, but searching around here might\npay off.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Tob_m01_001: I'm always ready to throw down.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Lil_m01_001: The desert is way too hot! How can it be real?!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Lil_m01_001: Think anyone dropped any sacks of cash by\nthe roadside?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Lil_m01_001: Life on the road is more my thing so far than\ntraveling by ship.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Lil_m01_001: Um, shouldn't we take a rest soon?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Lys_m01_001: This area seems rife with danger. We'd best proceed\nwith caution.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Lys_m01_001: Why don't we stop for a rest soon?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Lys_m01_001: Perhaps we ought to head off any potential threats.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Buc_m01_001: Walking around in the outdoors—a welcome\ndiversion.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Buc_m01_001: Rough roads around here. Proceed cautiously.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Buc_m01_001: Perhaps we'd better find a place to rest?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Buc_m01_001: What if I went and explored the area? I think there\nmight be something useful.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Sci_m01_001: Sandstorms—quite the nuisance. They erase your\nfootprints from the ground.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Sci_m01_001: Humid clime, heavier winds.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Sci_m01_001: Swiftly blowing over a thousand miles... It doesn't\nseem possible.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Sci_m01_001: Let's not strain ourselves.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Moo_m01_001: My feet hurt from all this walking. Not saying I'm\nsurprised, but— Ow.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Moo_m01_001: I can hang in there. I'm my mother's daughter,\naren't I? She trained me!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Moo_m01_001: Wonder if there's something here?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Moo_m01_001: Something's off. I think we need to watch out.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Oly_m01_001: My clothes—my body. They're positively covered\nin sand!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Oly_m01_001: I thought I knew what "darkness" was, until I saw\nthese unlit streets...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Oly_m01_001: The farther away we go from the city, the more I\nmiss the comfort of a warm bed.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Oly_m01_001: I should have bought shoes that were better suited\nfor all this walking.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Gat_m01_001: So much time's passed since that young man crossed\nthe sea, journeying to foreign lands.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Gat_m01_001: A road leading to who-knows-where. I'd call this\nauspicious.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Gat_m01_001: Oh, it's nothing. You're talking to someone who's\nwalked the road north of Rama.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Gat_m01_001: I'm too old to be pushing myself this hard.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Max_m01_001: My makeup! It's rubbing off.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Max_m01_001: Hehehe. Lotta walking! More than I thought...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Max_m01_001: Being a clown doesn't make it any easier to walk\nthese roads.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Max_m01_001: Been too long since I saw some blood. But I guess I\ncan wait.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Gol_m01_001: My feet keep sinking into the sand! Makes it really\nhard to walk.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Gol_m01_001: Love being outside! The city's so cramped.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Gol_m01_001: OK, even I'M getting tired.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Dan_m01_001: There's something to be said for the sun on your face\nand the wind on your skin.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Dan_m01_001: Quiet! I can't speak right now. I must commit to\npaper this next stanza.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Dan_m01_001: Not the most pressing matter, but I will have\nyou know...I am very tired.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Urs_m01_001: The sun feels different here... It's harsher than it is\nin my homeland.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Urs_m01_001: When I look at the ocean...it reminds me of home.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Urs_m01_001: I may not enjoy this part of the business, but I will\ndo what I must.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Sim_m01_001: I've fought in so many deserts that my body doesn't\neven sweat anymore.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Sim_m01_001: Doesn't look like we have anybody following us.\nMight be a good spot to take a break.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Sim_m01_001: Aren't places like these usually hiding treasure?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Sim_m01_001: I'm always ready to knock some heads around,\nespecially if it comes with a challenge.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Lou_m01_001: Fluffy bedding...hot meals... Ugh, I miss them\nso much...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Lou_m01_001: Now that you mention it, I could go for a snack.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Lou_m01_001: If it's dirty or smelly, please try not to get too\nclose, OK?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Fia_m01_001: It's awfully hot, isn't it...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Fia_m01_001: Traveling is so much harder than I thought it\nwould be.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Fia_m01_001: Um, excuse me... Maybe we would benefit from a\nlittle break soon...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Die_m01_001: I've got to admit...I don't like the desert.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Die_m01_001: We can always return to the city if things get too\ndifficult for us out here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Die_m01_001: For some reason, I feel a little more at ease in a\nplace like this.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Lor_m01_001: I hope there aren't any ghosts around here.\nToo creepy...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Lor_m01_001: Hey! How about we take a break?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Lor_m01_001: This place feels weird. Think there's something\nworth checking out?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Set_m01_001: How interesting... It's like a sea of sand.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Set_m01_001: We needn't worry about our surroundings. I'm quite\nadept in various environments.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Set_m01_001: Are you alright? Don't push yourself too hard.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Nin_m01_001: I feel dizzy and dazed here...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Nin_m01_001: The stars! How beautiful they are...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Nin_m01_001: I'm feeling worn and weary...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Nin_m01_001: I sense that something is near... Somewhere close by.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Sar_m01_001: I grew up in the desert, so I'm used to extremes in\nhot and cold.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Sar_m01_001: The world is so big, and yet there's people who don't\nhave anywhere they can go.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Sar_m01_001: Oh, what a time to realize I still need to mend the\nholes in my shoes.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Naz_m01_001: I can walk forever.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Naz_m01_001: This is nothing compared to living in the desert.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Naz_m01_001: Hey, maybe we oughta rest here for a bit?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Naz_m01_001: There any signs of an enemy? I hope they're strong.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Dai_m01_001: The trick to walking on sand is to take small steps.\nIt keeps your feet from sinking too much.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Dai_m01_001: Nothing. Is. Happening. I'm dying of boredom.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Dai_m01_001: I'm so, so tired right now...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Hal_m01_001: I think the heat's maybe making me dizzy?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Hal_m01_001: Just seeing the ocean makes me feel better.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Hal_m01_001: Ugh! I fell down. I swear I tripped on nothing!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Hal_m01_001: It's getting really hard to walk.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Guj_m01_001: Late hours like this are my best time for coming up\nwith new stories...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Guj_m01_001: A really villainous crew was following us earlier.\nBut I gave 'em a mean look. That took care of that!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Guj_m01_001: I'm getting a bit thirsty out here...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Ned_m01_001: No matter where you go across the land, people say\nthat all roads lead to Dagsion.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Ned_m01_001: I'm no stranger to rough paths like this.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Ned_m01_001: This is starting to get exhausting...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Noc_m01_001: You know, walking around in the open like this is\nbetter than I thought it'd be!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Noc_m01_001: I grew up in the mountains, so rough paths like this\nare usual for me.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Noc_m01_001: I've got a bad feeling... Like some enemies are\nnearby or something.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Sop_m01_001: It's pretty hot here, isn't it?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Sop_m01_001: I don't mind traveling like this, but my stomach is\nstarting to feel too empty.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Sop_m01_001: So hungry... Starving... Is it time to eat yet?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Sop_m01_001: Maybe we'll get lucky if we search for some food\naround here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Yan_m01_001: If you know how vast the world is, this continent\nstarts to feel very small.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Yan_m01_001: This is good physical training, even for those of us\nwho use magic by habit.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Yan_m01_001: Hmm. I'm getting sleepy...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Cat_m01_001: I've lived in the city for a long time. I'm not used to\ntraveling to such an extent.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Cat_m01_001: I must climb this terrain carefully. I mustn't get my\nfine outfit dirty.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Cat_m01_001: I don't think I can go much farther...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Maj_m01_001: The world's so damn big. Just goes on and on...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Maj_m01_001: I can handle walking around in a place like this, no\nproblem at all!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Maj_m01_001: It's about time to let loose!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Kir_m01_001: What a terrible place. It's just sand—everywhere!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Kir_m01_001: When it's dark...I sense eyes on me...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition03_Kir_m01_001: My mood always turns around when I see the open\nwaves. Damn, I miss being out on water.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Kir_m01_001: It'd be great if we could take paths nearer to water\nmore often...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Kir_m01_001: This is no way to treat someone! I'm owed a break\nat some point!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Iio_m01_001: I'm used to traveling, despite how I might look.\nI've got no problems with any of this.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Iio_m01_001: Could we take a break at some point? I'd like to\nmake sure Rocinan gets fed.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Iio_m01_001: I sense enemies at hand...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Nuz_m01_001: It gets awfully hot without shade to block the sun...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Nuz_m01_001: I am accustomed to long marches.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Nuz_m01_001: Let's take care not to get caught up in any snares.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Nuz_m01_001: Our trek is testing the limits of even my endurance.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Nuz_m01_001: Hold. There may be something useful here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Pep_m01_001: This is unfathomably hot!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Pep_m01_001: So much walking... What an experience it is to\ntraverse like this!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Pep_m01_001: We are never discouraged by a path of\npoor quality!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Zac_m01_001: What am I doing here... Seriously...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Zac_m01_001: Ugh, we passed a village a while ago... I could steal\neverything there on a dark night like this.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Zac_m01_001: How'd I get myself into being dragged around\nlike this?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Ven_m01_001: Advance! Onward!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Ven_m01_001: Ha haa! This path won't defeat me!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Ven_m01_001: Hey, you going to just keep marching an old man\naround like this?!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Ven_m01_001: Stay vigilant when you're marching through\nenemy territory!
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Jas_m01_001: Be careful on night marches. You can trip over your\nown feet.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition07_Jas_m01_001: There's something about this place... Maybe we\nshould look around here.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Jas_m01_001: Time to earn some money?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Ale_m01_001: It's really hot, don't you think?
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Ale_m01_001: I'm feeling a bit faint...
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Ale_m01_001: Let's brace ourselves as we continue.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Ini_m01_001: Walking around outside always makes me feel a\nlittle brighter.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Ini_m01_001: Please... Let's rest when we can.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition08_Ini_m01_001: I hope to stay out of trouble out here, but maybe we\ndon't have a choice.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Mra_m01_001: Let's hurry on.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition05_Mra_m01_001: Hah. The roads around here haven't changed.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition06_Mra_m01_001: Tired? Let me play you a song.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition01_Tah_m01_001: I hate getting sand in my shoes.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition02_Tah_m01_001: It gets cold at night. You have to stay dry, or you'll\nget chilly.
MID_Gmap_Fix_Condition04_Tah_m01_001: Our goal's in sight. Keep moving forward.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kai1_m01_001: You can never train too much.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kai1_m02_001: The sky's kinda really far up there, huh?
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kai1_m03_001: I wonder if there's someplace we could go fishing...
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Tia1_m01_001: One thing I've learned is that you increase your\nchances of tripping if you read while walking.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Tia1_m02_001: I wonder how my grandpa's doing.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Tia1_m03_001: It strikes me as useful to note which strategies have\nproven most effective against the risen dead.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Pet1_m01_001: I keep thinking that cloud we saw looked tasty...
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Pet1_m02_001: It'd be nice if we could relax, at least a little bit.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Pet1_m03_001: I'm really good with my bow, but I'm a lousy hunter.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Moo1_m01_001: Is there anything tastier than veggie hot pot?
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Moo1_m02_001: You don't realize how big the world is until you go\nout and explore it.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Moo1_m03_001: Y'know, I'd love to learn how to play an instrument.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Lor1_m01_001: Huh... The world's full of all kinds of stuff.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Lor1_m02_001: Sleeping on the ground's rough. My body hurts!
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Lor1_m03_001: I'll follow you anywhere...
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Max_m01_001: You know, I'd like to make some new designs—\nmaybe based on the flowers in the south.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Max_m02_001: I just wish we had peace.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Max_m03_001: Am I Maxim or Jester? Sometimes I get confused.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kou_m01_001: The warmth of the fire reminds me that I'm alive.\nIt helps ease my nerves a little.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kou_m02_001: Even in the face of such catastrophe, humanity is\nsurprisingly resilient.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kou_m03_001: I can still remember the last time I was truly happy.\nIt was...long, long ago.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kra_m01_001: In better times, I could have ordered mountains of\nthe finest ingredients from my homeland.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kra_m02_001: Avail yourself of specialty Mosa dishes, prepared by\nthe skilled hands of yours truly!
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Kra_m03_001: This exchange of views with warriors from foreign\nlands is surprisingly refreshing.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Nat_m01_001: Never stop watching your surroundings. Not even\nwhen you sleep.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Nat_m02_001: Saving the world. What better reason could there be\nto risk your life?
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Nat_m03_001: I have no issue being compared to a catoblepas,\nbut please. I'm not that headstrong.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Hri_m01_001: Mystery of mysteries, there really is a Promised One.\nI'd like to get to the bottom of that.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Hri_m02_001: It's just like when I was a commoner.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Hri_m03_001: I don't at all mind being called Pantere.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Asw_m01_001: Given our circumstances, we cannot stop attending\nto everyone's health.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Asw_m02_001: Not long ago, I couldn't have imagined enjoying a\nmeal outside the castle. How nice.
MID_Gmap_Banquet_Asw_m03_001: In rare moments, one forgets their troubles and can\nsimply relax.
